<%- include('partials/header', { fullWidth: true, metaDescription: 'Free canoe polo tactics board: drag kayaks around a full-size pitch, draw runs and passes, build plays step by step and share them with your team.' }) %>

<div class="page-banner">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="crumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> / Tactics board</p>
    <h1>Tactics board</h1>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="wrap tactics" id="tactics">
  <noscript><p class="notice red">The tactics board needs JavaScript switched on.</p></noscript>

  <div class="tb-bar" role="toolbar" aria-label="Tactics board tools">
    <label class="tb-preset"><span>Start from</span>
      <select id="tb-preset" aria-label="Start from a preset"></select>
    </label>
    <div class="tb-tools" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Tool">
      <button type="button" class="tb-tool on" data-tool="move" role="radio" aria-checked="true" title="Move boats and ball (M)">Move</button>
      <button type="button" class="tb-tool" data-tool="run" role="radio" aria-checked="false" title="Draw a paddling run (R)"><span class="sw sw-run" aria-hidden="true"></span>Run</button>
      <button type="button" class="tb-tool" data-tool="pass" role="radio" aria-checked="false" title="Draw a pass (P)"><span class="sw sw-pass" aria-hidden="true"></span>Pass</button>
      <button type="button" class="tb-tool" data-tool="shot" role="radio" aria-checked="false" title="Draw a shot (S)"><span class="sw sw-shot" aria-hidden="true"></span>Shot</button>
      <button type="button" class="tb-tool" data-tool="erase" role="radio" aria-checked="false" title="Click a line to delete it (E)">Erase line</button>
    </div>
    <div class="tb-actions">
      <button type="button" class="btn small" id="tb-undo" title="Undo (Ctrl+Z)">Undo</button>
      <button type="button" class="btn small" id="tb-flip" title="Swap ends">Swap ends</button>
      <button type="button" class="btn small" id="tb-clear" title="Remove all lines in this step">Clear lines</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="tb-stage">
    <svg id="tb-pitch" viewBox="-2.5 -1.6 40 27.1" role="img" aria-label="Canoe polo pitch, 35 by 23 metres">
      <title>Canoe polo pitch</title>
    </svg>
  </div>

  <div class="tb-steps">
    <div class="tb-steps-head">
      <strong>Steps</strong>
      <ol id="tb-steplist" class="tb-steplist"></ol>
      <button type="button" class="btn small" id="tb-addstep" title="Copy this step and move boats for the next phase">+ Add step</button>
      <button type="button" class="btn small danger" id="tb-delstep">Delete step</button>
      <button type="button" class="btn small primary" id="tb-play">▶ Play</button>
    </div>
    <label class="tb-note"><span>Coaching note for this step</span>
      <textarea id="tb-note" rows="2" maxlength="400" placeholder="e.g. Number 3 screens the goalkeeper while 5 cuts across for the shot."></textarea>
    </label>
  </div>

  <div class="tb-share">
    <button type="button" class="btn primary" id="tb-copy">Copy share link</button>
    <button type="button" class="btn" id="tb-png">Download image</button>
    <span id="tb-status" class="small-note" role="status" aria-live="polite"></span>
  </div>

  <div class="tb-help">
    <h2 class="sub-head">How to use it</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Move boats:</strong> drag a kayak. Drag the small dot at its nose to turn it. With a boat selected you can also use the arrow keys, and <kbd>Q</kbd>/<kbd>E</kbd> to turn.</li>
      <li><strong>Draw:</strong> pick <em>Run</em>, <em>Pass</em> or <em>Shot</em>, then drag across the pitch. Use <em>Erase line</em> and click a line to remove it.</li>
      <li><strong>Build a play:</strong> press <em>+ Add step</em>, move the boats to where they go next, and repeat. <em>Play</em> animates the whole move.</li>
      <li><strong>Share:</strong> <em>Copy share link</em> puts the whole play in a link you can send to your team. Your board is also kept in this browser for next time.</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="small-note">Pitch drawn to scale: 35 × 23 m, 3 m kayaks, goals 1.5 m wide. Presets are starting points for discussion, not official formations. See the <a href="/rules">rules</a> for what's legal.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<script src="/tactics.js"></script>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
